# Fetichism (Bastok 1-3): begun and finished in Metalworks. A level 10 Warrior of Bastok holding the four Quadav
# Fetich parts (1-1 and 1-2 completed by a GM; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out). Malduc: section 1: 1001, finished
# with 2: Metalworks' own handleAcceptMission registration: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Section 2:
# ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6; one part: no match, no event; the four: 1008, finished (completed, parts taken). The
# mission current again (a GM), the parts given again: 1005, finished: Metalworks' 1005 handler.
lists Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1005 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1008
char zone=Metalworks pos=64,-14,-4 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
login
trigger Malduc                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=2                         # 2: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Malduc                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 6
walk 66,-15,2
trade Malduc QuadavFetichHead x1        # one part: no event
trade Malduc QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1008
finish                                  # completed; the parts taken
mission Bastok Fetichism current        # a GM
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
trade Malduc QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # 1005
finish                                  # completed again
